{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mostlyEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLSyncV4KindO11mostlyEventyA2EmF","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"symbolKind":"case","roleHeading":"Case","role":"symbol","title":"MXLSync.Kind.mostlyEvent"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum\/mostlyevent"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum\/mostlyEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mostlyEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A combination of tempo and event synchronization, giving more weight to performed events.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSync","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLSync","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The sync type specifies the style that a score following application should use to synchronize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accompaniment with a performer. If this type is not included in a score, default synchronization depends on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the application."}],"title":"MXLSync"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync/Kind-swift.enum":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Kind"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MXLSync.Kind","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The sync-type type specifies the style that a score following application should use to synchronize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accompaniment with a performer. The none type indicates no synchronization to the performer. The tempo type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates synchronization based on the performer tempo rather than individual events in the score. The event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"type indicates synchronization by following the performance of individual events in the score rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the performer tempo. The mostly-tempo and mostly-event types combine these two approaches, with mostly-tempo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"giving more weight to tempo and mostly-event giving more weight to performed events. The always-event type"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provides the strictest synchronization by not being forgiving of missing performed events."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Kind","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}],"title":"IvorMXL","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSync/Kind-swift.enum/mostlyEvent":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSync\/Kind-swift.enum\/mostlyEvent","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mostlyEvent"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsync\/kind-swift.enum\/mostlyevent","abstract":[{"text":"A combination of tempo and event synchronization, giving more weight to performed events.","type":"text"}],"title":"MXLSync.Kind.mostlyEvent"}}}